  "description": "Performance on two wheels: the eBike Sport 2023 from Porsche, developed in partnership with ROTWILD, is impressive in both design and performance. The full-suspension carbon frame and latest powerful Shimano drive unit make the eBike the perfect companion for leisure trips and journeys of discovery. A high level of riding comfort, both on and off the road, is guaranteed thanks to MAGURA disc brakes, upside-down suspension forks and Fox rear shock absorber. The robust Crankbrothers wheels ensure maximum directional stability and longevity. The eBike also impresses visually with its sporty, elegant all-black look and clean frame design by Studio F. A. Porsche. See the PDF file for more information.\nSuitable frame size based on body height in centimetres:\nFrame size S (27 inch wheels): 156–170 cm.\nFrame size M (29 inch wheels): 168–182 cm.\nFrame size L (29 inch wheels): 180–194 cm.\nDETAILS:\nBattery: 630 Wh capacity (size S: 504 Wh).\nCarbon frame with 100 mm spring deflection designed by Studio F. A. Porsche, developed in partnership with ROTWILD.\nMAGURA Boltron upside-down suspension fork with 100 mm spring deflection.\nFox Float DPS air damper.\nShimano EP801 motor with max. 85 Nm torque.\nShimano battery with 630 Wh (size S: 504 Wh).\nShimano Di2 12-speed rear derailleur.\nMAGURA MCi disc brakes: four pistons front and rear, cylinder integrated in the handlebar.\nLight integration by Supernova: front light integrated into the handlebar stem with high beam function, rear light with deceleration signal integrated in the seat post.\nCrankbrothers Iodine 2 wheel set.",
